\[CloseCurlyQuote]s newer \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]indexer sector,\
\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] and again in the older \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]\
\[ScriptCapitalU]\[ScriptCapitalD] sector\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] via an \
existing gradient operator. \
\>", "Subitem",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.980276862033346*^9, 3.9802769235149193`*^9}, {
   3.980331819070505*^9, 3.9803318288046923`*^9}, {3.980775194890999*^9, 
