Cell[TextData[{
 "Here are the old Euler-Lagrange definitions without the explanations that \
appear in the old notebook. All we really need from this is the ",
 StyleBox["Echo", "Input"],
 " of the Euler-Lagrange equations at the end and the setups for the \
visualizations to follow."
}], "Text",
