 CellLabel->
  "Out[218]=",ExpressionUUID->"c24a6cea-224b-468f-bcc2-68bc05b5de12"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "These four components are a lot easier to intuit than the ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["32", TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "1b567867-4eda-4774-9d2b-5d02649c8cd6"],
 " independent components of the Christoffel symbols in 4D spacetime, which \
we have seen in earlier notebooks on general relativity. However, the \
geometrical meaning is 100% analogous. We get centrifugal and Coriolis forces \
if we move around curved, ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"S", "\[VeryThinSpace]", 
    RowBox[{"O", "(", "3", ")"}]}], TraditionalForm]],
  FormatType->TraditionalForm,ExpressionUUID->
  "028752dc-e1e0-4bdf-99c5-3879f9ad2939"],
 " coordinate space along geodesics in 3D. We get tidal forces and \
frame-dragging forces if we move around curved spacetime caused by massive \
objects in 4D. "
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.980447634954762*^9, 3.980447832472693*^9}, {
  3.980461325542448*^9, 3.980461327735361*^9}, {3.980461682690094*^9, 
  3.980461757253628*^9}, {3.9804656766686363`*^9, 3.980465703331959*^9}, {
  3.9804989897959347`*^9, 3.980499000839375*^9}, {3.980518526388156*^9, 
  3.980518546177449*^9}, {3.980542173990513*^9, 3.980542187291263*^9}, {
  3.9806884245245857`*^9, 3.9806884246968307`*^9}, {3.980883708960257*^9, 
  3.980883750264944*^9}, {3.980953745746953*^9, 3.980953750362055*^9}, {
  3.9812404098622217`*^9, 3.981240488141739*^9}, {3.981240532206377*^9, 
  3.981240537164671*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"c9c62f8e-9df7-4c7c-86d4-\
93ea5eb6d9d1"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["All Forces from Connections", "Subsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9809537669142447`*^9, 
  3.980953775750515*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"fada581f-4db5-4fea-acb1-\
81bb33978b9f"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "We have repeatedly claimed in various notebooks that ALL forces come from \
connections. What about those \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]forces from potentials\
\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] on the right-hand side of the new equations of \
motion? It turns out that they are the ",
 StyleBox["time-time",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " components of 4D connections. We\[CloseCurlyQuote]ll leave that analysis \
for another notebook, and just take them on the right-hand side for now. That \
keeps the analysis smaller so we can explain it intuitively."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.980447634954762*^9, 3.980447832472693*^9}, {
  3.980461325542448*^9, 3.980461327735361*^9}, {3.980461682690094*^9, 
  3.9804618267006407`*^9}, {3.980465711338518*^9, 3.9804657298987713`*^9}, {
  3.9805167948192453`*^9, 3.9805168087801733`*^9}, {3.98051855206285*^9, 
  3.9805185763084183`*^9}, {3.980688849717539*^9, 3.9806888836196947`*^9}, {
  3.9806889174787292`*^9, 3.980688917838574*^9}, {3.980705310735648*^9, 
  3.98070535748517*^9}, {3.980705405440501*^9, 3.9807054183156652`*^9}, {
  3.9808837565859222`*^9, 
  3.9808838625582047`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"6e159483-5cd5-4472-a28e-\
5f0de00cff23"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Geometric Equations of Motion", "Subsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9809538505837297`*^9, 
  3.9809538628204536`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"874aa61a-0537-4d90-b54f-\
bc3db998a986"],

Cell["\<\
Let\[CloseCurlyQuote]s re-derive the equations of motion geometrically, then \
show them equal to our old equations of motion, derived via the \
Euler-Lagrange process. We\[CloseCurlyQuote]ll repeat the new derivation \
twice using two different sectors of the \[ScriptCapitalU]\[ScriptCapitalD] \
toolkit: first, the newer, component-based \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]indexer\
\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] sector and then the older, rule-based \
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]\[ScriptCapitalU]\[ScriptCapitalD]\
\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] sector. These sectors can be freely mixed and \
matched. The indexer sector has the advantage of conciseness, but at the cost \
of explicit index up-ness and down-ness. The indexer sector is analogous to a \
weakly typed sub-language. The \[ScriptCapitalU]\[ScriptCapitalD] sector \
requires more code, but keeps track of the variance and valence. The \
\[ScriptCapitalU]\[ScriptCapitalD] sector is analogous to a strongly typed \
sub-language.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.980441637922883*^9, 3.980441669289631*^9}, {
  3.980461836376405*^9, 3.980461889332862*^9}, {3.980542217500667*^9, 
  3.980542317154791*^9}, {3.980542430564048*^9, 3.980542618171533*^9}, {
  3.980688928009721*^9, 3.980688976364204*^9}, {3.980705485287521*^9, 
  3.980705500865958*^9}, {3.980883888081127*^9, 3.980883997894947*^9}, {
  3.980954029308238*^9, 3.9809540299607697`*^9}, {3.981240600305081*^9, 
  3.981240612328115*^9}, {3.9812406465839443`*^9, 
  3.981240649331723*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"a46a6149-3765-49c3-b52e-\
7a14e7907152"],

Cell["\<\
Start with the same old kinetic and potential energies, geometrically, this \
time: \
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.980284686232793*^9, 3.9802851150934467`*^9}, {
  3.980325824950123*^9, 3.98032599647747*^9}, {3.98046189868652*^9, 
  3.9804618994195766`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"c26f91c4-46f0-40b8-baac-\
323d0a954fac"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Kinetic Energy ", "Subsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9802851238528357`*^9, 3.9802851283698387`*^9}, {
  3.980353836680812*^9, 
  3.980353840245016*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"c2a7292a-36e9-4605-bcd5-\
abefeaddad1c"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Fish kinetic energy out of the definitions above, knowing that ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"m", "->", "1"}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "0dfa44f8-d43f-4aed-969c-16c082aacb48"],
 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox["c", "z"], "->", "1.2"}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "c205e0da-8e80-4788-9257-abca8a5a6124"],
 " have already been applied. Or just intuit kinetic energy from the familiar \
",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    FractionBox["1", "2"], 
    SubscriptBox["I", "1"], 
    SuperscriptBox["\[Omega]", 
     RowBox[{" ", "2"}]]}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "d46174c6-30bc-4b8b-848f-b35b29b0c7c1"],
 ". Or just read the old notebook. In any event:"
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.980285504815722*^9, 3.980285560257476*^9}, {
  3.980285592331505*^9, 3.980285616959238*^9}, {3.9803260292445*^9, 
  3.980326030896184*^9}, {3.9803319755446463`*^9, 3.9803320373159657`*^9}, {
  3.980353797048766*^9, 3.98035386409169*^9}, {3.9804619065719843`*^9, 
  3.980461931969512*^9}, {3.980979305657228*^9, 3.980979314662525*^9}, {
  3.981240670085351*^9, 
  3.981240674439125*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"459a208f-2b6a-46b4-b085-\
01957f503a3a"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"T", "=", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"1", "/", "2"}], " ", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"(", "1.2", ")"}], "^", "2"}], " ", 
   RowBox[{"(", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"D\[Delta]", "^", "2"}], "+", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"(", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"1", "/", "2"}], " ", 
        RowBox[{"(", 
         RowBox[{"1", "+", 
          RowBox[{"Cos", "[", 
           RowBox[{"2", "\[Delta]"}], "]"}]}], ")"}]}], ")"}], 
      RowBox[{"D\[Eta]", "^", "2"}]}]}], ")"}]}]}]], "Input",
 Evaluatable->False,
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9804619438772993`*^9, 
  3.9804619475027847`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"e002a8df-679a-4641-b288-\
8992e47c64d0"],

Cell["is the code. In traditional notation, it is", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.980461957099216*^9, 3.980461977075266*^9}, {
  3.9805186052839622`*^9, 
  3.980518613991848*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"9ebe8c73-6f0c-4aab-8d21-\
52eb05591d24"],

Cell[BoxData[
 FormBox[
  RowBox[{"T", "    ", "=", "    ", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     FractionBox["1", "2"], "m", " ", 
     RowBox[{
      SuperscriptBox[
       SubscriptBox["c", "z"], "2"], "(", 
      RowBox[{
       SuperscriptBox[
        RowBox[{"(", 
         RowBox[{"\[Delta]", "'"}], ")"}], "2"], "+", 
       RowBox[{
        SuperscriptBox[
         RowBox[{"(", 
          RowBox[{"\[Eta]", "'"}], ")"}], "2"], " ", 
        RowBox[{"(", 
         RowBox[{
          FractionBox["1", "2"], 
          RowBox[{"(", 
           RowBox[{"1", "+", 
            RowBox[{"cos", " ", "2", "\[Delta]"}]}], ")"}]}], ")"}]}]}], 
      ")"}]}], "    ", "=", "    ", 
    RowBox[{
     FractionBox["1", "2"], "m", " ", 
     RowBox[{
      SuperscriptBox[
       SubscriptBox["c", "z"], "2"], "(", 
      RowBox[{
       SuperscriptBox[
        RowBox[{"(", 
         RowBox[{"\[Delta]", "'"}], ")"}], "2"], "+", 
       RowBox[{
        SuperscriptBox[
         RowBox[{"(", 
          RowBox[{"\[Eta]", "'"}], ")"}], "2"], " ", 
        SuperscriptBox["cos", "2"], "\[Delta]"}]}], ")"}]}]}]}], 
  TraditionalForm]], "DisplayFormulaNumbered",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.98028521221717*^9, 3.980285241853819*^9}, {
  3.980285289097499*^9, 3.98028536847361*^9}, {3.9802854068178596`*^9, 
  3.980285491549489*^9}, {3.980285679899845*^9, 3.980285679900921*^9}, {
  3.9803276211188793`*^9, 3.980327659344922*^9}},
 CellTags->
  "GEOMETRIC KINETIC ENERGY \
SO3/SO2",ExpressionUUID->"0b93acd3-1c7c-4f15-a5d6-1673973cc566"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "via the half-angle formula ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"(", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      SuperscriptBox["cos", "2"], "\[Delta]"}], "=", 
     RowBox[{
      FractionBox["1", "2"], 
      RowBox[{"(", 
       RowBox[{"1", "+", 
        RowBox[{"cos", " ", "2", "\[Delta]"}]}], ")"}]}]}], ")"}], 
   TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->"0d7b60a4-ec0a-4a81-97fb-1c7996ec339d"],
 ". Of course, \[Delta], \[Eta], and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["T", TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "a0c3255f-4963-4e44-9937-852a57d24aa0"],
 " are functions of coordinate time, ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["t", TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "dfdfbf3e-d96b-4f28-a58e-72cc6160bf8e"],
 ", here Newtonian time."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.980285625602447*^9, 3.980285664392153*^9}, {
  3.9802858221981297`*^9, 3.980285854727281*^9}, {3.980326055655727*^9, 
  3.980326072139943*^9}, {3.98088403588446*^9, 
  3.980884046221238*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"fdb08739-ca86-4c17-abea-\
995b477ea997"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox["c", "z"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "7154ba8b-46a1-4fe3-8436-79ec0f9c14a3"],
 StyleBox[" is half the length of the baton, the height of the center of mass \
in the Z direction when the baton is straight up. Nothing to do with ",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["c", TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "fe200151-e2a8-4160-838b-195baa5a5ea3"],
 StyleBox[", the speed of light.",
  FontSlant->"Italic"]
}], "Item",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9808841840764923`*^9, 3.98088423692426*^9}, {
  3.9809541529214897`*^9, 
  3.980954175167686*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"a54d4e59-82b0-4b16-a970-\
a3cb2cf423f3"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Metric Tensor times Velocities", "Subsubsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9802859034480753`*^9, 3.980285911485372*^9}, {
  3.980286128378147*^9, 3.9802861344661493`*^9}, {3.980329050052899*^9, 
  3.980329051305575*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"81b0c56e-02aa-4957-816e-\
9e74d4f00182"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "It\[CloseCurlyQuote]s obvious that ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["T", TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "5a9135af-99fe-41c6-8cf3-a8a483108deb"],
 " has syntactic structure as a row vector of coordinate velocities times a \
matrix times a column vector of coordinate velocities:"
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.980326221476226*^9, 3.9803262419794407`*^9}, {
   3.980326752872756*^9, 3.980326776090629*^9}, {3.980327686180975*^9, 
   3.980327686390719*^9}, 3.9803540269396963`*^9, {3.980462009988762*^9, 
   3.9804620423738737`*^9}, {3.980499138471839*^9, 3.980499234207658*^9}, {
   3.980518627973534*^9, 
   3.980518637889817*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"7548bdf9-bc21-4e95-b814-\
375c10c11135"],

Cell[BoxData[
 FormBox[
  RowBox[{"T", "  ", "=", "  ", 
   RowBox[{
    FractionBox["1", "2"], "m", " ", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      SuperscriptBox[
       SubscriptBox["c", "z"], "2"], "(", GridBox[{
        {
         RowBox[{"\[Delta]", "'"}], 
         RowBox[{"\[Eta]", "'"}]}
       }], ")"}], "\[CenterDot]", 
     RowBox[{"(", GridBox[{
        {"1", "0"},
        {"0", 
         RowBox[{
          SuperscriptBox["cos", "2"], "\[Delta]"}]}
       }], ")"}], "\[CenterDot]", 
     RowBox[{"(", GridBox[{
        {
         RowBox[{"\[Delta]", "'"}]},
        {
         RowBox[{"\[Eta]", "'"}]}
       }], ")"}]}]}]}], TraditionalForm]], "DisplayFormulaNumbered",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9803262555236073`*^9, 3.980326458257868*^9}, 
   3.980326492400792*^9, {3.980326693453355*^9, 3.980326718017737*^9}, {
   3.980327065875412*^9, 3.980327070845006*^9}, 3.98032861954846*^9, {
   3.980354031386326*^9, 3.980354039192286*^9}, {3.980542348158036*^9, 
   3.980542373508637*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"3dae05e6-7030-49e8-8627-\
6d158da086ff"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "See this in tensorial terms as contraction of a covariant velocity covector \
(index lowered by contraction against a metric tensor, ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox["g", 
    RowBox[{"\[Mu]", " ", "\[Nu]"}]], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "1a8d25b4-b98c-4ce4-a1ab-2f599eb48ff5"],
 ") with a contravariant velocity vector:"
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.980327074226747*^9, 3.980327101454464*^9}, {
   3.980499236778976*^9, 3.9804992473013573`*^9}, {3.9805423780623837`*^9, 
   3.980542381721875*^9}, 3.980689030533239*^9, {3.980954106152072*^9, 
   3.980954138785727*^9}, {3.981240807682024*^9, 
   3.981240811453084*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"49de6ee7-4784-4ce8-a4e3-\
0f0f2a30980f"],

Cell[BoxData[
 FormBox[
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    FractionBox["1", "2"], "m", " ", 
    SuperscriptBox[
     SubscriptBox["c", "z"], "2"], 
    StyleBox[
     SubscriptBox["g", 
      RowBox[{"\[VeryThinSpace]", 
       RowBox[{"\[Mu]", " ", "\[Nu]"}]}]],
     FontColor->RGBColor[0.14, 0.8, 0.14]], 
    StyleBox[
     SuperscriptBox[
      OverscriptBox["x", "\[FilledSmallCircle]"], 
      RowBox[{" ", "\[Mu]"}]],
     FontColor->RGBColor[0.14, 0.8, 0.14]], 
    SuperscriptBox[
     OverscriptBox["x", "\[FilledSmallCircle]"], 
     RowBox[{" ", "\[Nu]"}]]}], "    ", "=", "    ", 
   RowBox[{
    FractionBox["1", "2"], "m", " ", 
    SuperscriptBox[
     SubscriptBox["c", "z"], "2"], 
    StyleBox[
     SubscriptBox[
      OverscriptBox["x", "\[FilledSmallCircle]"], 
      RowBox[{" ", "\[Nu]"}]],
     FontColor->RGBColor[0.14, 0.8, 0.14]], 
    SuperscriptBox[
     OverscriptBox["x", "\[FilledSmallCircle]"], 
     RowBox[{" ", "\[Nu]"}]]}]}], TraditionalForm]], "DisplayFormulaNumbered",\

 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9803262555236073`*^9, 3.980326458257868*^9}, 
   3.980326492400792*^9, {3.980326693453355*^9, 3.980326718017737*^9}, {
   3.9803270931854258`*^9, 3.980327108579023*^9}, {3.980327703233892*^9, 
   3.9803277057143517`*^9}, {3.980328625088241*^9, 3.9803286281287518`*^9}, {
   3.980462058261012*^9, 3.9804620977500973`*^9}, {3.980689044526865*^9, 
   3.980689048227338*^9}, {3.9812407845834208`*^9, 
   3.9812407850089912`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"3c0c1122-aba3-44b5-ba09-\
cf05a1f21fc0"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Except for the factor of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"(", 
    RowBox[{"m", " ", 
     RowBox[{
      SuperscriptBox[
       SubscriptBox["c", "z"], "2"], "/", "2"}]}], ")"}], TraditionalForm]],
  ExpressionUUID->"c80787d5-fad3-410e-b8ee-13e312303923"],
 ", this is square length of the tangent to a line element, metricized by ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox["g", 
    RowBox[{"\[Mu]", " ", "\[Nu]"}]], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "03abbcd9-5ff1-419f-bec6-a193b185dd81"],
 ", along a curve specified by ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"x", "(", "t", ")"}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "e2ebe59f-f5ee-452d-a641-0615d583f217"],
 ". Configuration space ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{"\[Delta]", ",", "\[Eta]"}], "\[NonBreakingSpace]", "}"}], 
   TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->"e7b42470-9908-451a-9e32-68ef67313a12"],
 " is not flat, it\[CloseCurlyQuote]s a sphere where separation between lines \
of longitude shrink with ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"cos", " ", "\[Delta]"}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "f34c6d82-5b1c-4ba4-ba94-488019f71651"],
 ". That\[CloseCurlyQuote]s the coordinate realization of the topological \
fact that ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"S", "\[VeryThinSpace]", 
    RowBox[{"O", "(", "3", ")"}]}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "02f34718-9465-4da8-aa1f-bb574165f281"],
 " has an essential singularity."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.980286768722558*^9, 3.980286783121511*^9}, {
   3.980327114369506*^9, 3.980327231436817*^9}, {3.980327295473173*^9, 
   3.980327540254622*^9}, 3.980328192519809*^9, {3.9803285012482243`*^9, 
   3.980328589582862*^9}, {3.9803286372341433`*^9, 3.9803286399353228`*^9}, {
   3.980328673428338*^9, 3.9803287068041897`*^9}, {3.9803540647195044`*^9, 
   3.9803541343288507`*^9}, 3.980462006109082*^9, {3.980462109300674*^9, 
   3.980462130515477*^9}, {3.9805424112600603`*^9, 3.980542411507883*^9}, {
   3.980689062530017*^9, 3.980689078050106*^9}, {3.980884094620247*^9, 
   3.9808841638045263`*^9}, {3.980884260981059*^9, 3.980884302059948*^9}, {
   3.980954195282301*^9, 3.9809542340997047`*^9}, {3.981240852166287*^9, 
   3.981240874739212*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"a6e72f38-96f4-4be5-aaf7-\
b32f41d17dd2"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[TextData[{
 "Reproduce Equation ",
 
 CounterBox["DisplayFormulaNumbered", "GEOMETRIC KINETIC ENERGY SO3/SO2"]
}], "Subsubsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.980954278771902*^9, 
  3.980954305899122*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"47b69d2b-337e-4e96-b069-\
c345f6fdfee9"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "First, reproduce Equation ",
 
 CounterBox["DisplayFormulaNumbered", "GEOMETRIC KINETIC ENERGY SO3/SO2"],
 " in the indexer sector of \[ScriptCapitalU]\[ScriptCapitalD] via the \
functions ",
 StyleBox["MakeIndexer", "Input",
  FontColor->RGBColor[0.14, 0.8, 0.14]],
 " and ",
 StyleBox["ContractIndexedAll", "Input",
  FontColor->RGBColor[0.14, 0.8, 0.14]],
 ". Then move on to the equations of motion via ",
 StyleBox["ChristoffelsFromMetricIndexer", "Input",
  FontColor->RGBColor[0.14, 0.8, 0.14]],
 ". "
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.980499284850456*^9, 3.980499315039825*^9}, {
  3.980500282021858*^9, 3.980500348395165*^9}, {3.98050040361899*^9, 
  3.980500406100471*^9}, {3.980500483033617*^9, 3.980500502115991*^9}, {
  3.980500623649173*^9, 3.980500722828513*^9}, {3.9805187034470463`*^9, 
  3.980518716036874*^9}, {3.980542422322801*^9, 3.98054242281395*^9}, {
  3.980542631254304*^9, 3.980542641857122*^9}, {3.980689086564411*^9, 
  3.980689113850634*^9}, {3.9808843087653723`*^9, 3.980884318573997*^9}, {
  3.980954317363352*^9, 
  3.980954317459456*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"3562858a-5bd9-42a0-88f6-\
521a704cb1c7"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Set up coordinates and a time-injector. We\[CloseCurlyQuote]ll need the \
time-injector because explicit time dependence, e.g., ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"\[Delta]", "[", "t", "]"}], ",", " ", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"\[Delta]", "'"}], "[", "t", "]"}]}], TraditionalForm]],
  ExpressionUUID->"ae35e369-23f5-4d19-a709-2c80d8601671"],
 ", etc., is necessary for numerical solution via ",
 StyleBox["NDSolve", "Input"],
 ". "
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9805188880286427`*^9, 3.980518927318322*^9}, {
  3.980518968793583*^9, 3.98051899724699*^9}, {3.980542656032305*^9, 
  3.980542661435628*^9}, {3.980545541663827*^9, 3.980545578833686*^9}, {
  3.980884346037084*^9, 
  3.980884352892662*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"ac5293ba-2c95-4596-aa94-\
c91bd258939d"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"coords", "=", 
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{"\[Delta]", ",", "\[Eta]"}], "}"}]}], ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"ClearAll", "[", 
   StyleBox["injectTime",
    FontColor->RGBColor[0, 0.74, 0.74]], "]"}], 
  ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["injectTime",
    FontColor->RGBColor[0, 0.74, 0.74]], "=", 
   RowBox[{"Echo", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"Flatten", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"(", 
        RowBox[{"c", "|->", 
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"c", "->", 
            RowBox[{"c", "[", "t", "]"}]}], ",", 
