    " ", "\"\<\!\(\*OverscriptBox[\(x\), \(\[FilledSmallCircle]\
\[FilledSmallCircle]\)]\)\!\(\*SuperscriptBox[\(\\\ \), \(\[Mu]\)]\) + \
