Cell["\<\
The term \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]gauge\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] is used in \
physics in at least five different ways:\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.98095151954937*^9, 3.980951588699492*^9}, {
  3.9812422279688396`*^9, 
  3.981242247510565*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"505bce82-668a-4a2b-b29d-\
